  <h1><span class="lang-zh">拿去用:壁纸、电影画面、贴纸</span><span class="lang-en">Take them: wallpapers, film stills, stickers</span></h1>
  <p class="lede"><span class="lang-zh">位图由本机 Codex 调 gpt-6-astra 画,像素尺寸写在每张下面,没有放大过;代码画的 SVG 可以无损放大,也能改颜色和字。提示词原文、参考图和挑选理由都记在 <code>references/image-prompts.md</code>,拿去照着出自己的一套。</span><span class="lang-en">The bitmaps were drawn by gpt-6-astra through the local Codex CLI; each shows its real pixel size, none are upscaled. The code-drawn SVGs scale without loss and take new colours and words. Prompts, reference images and why each was picked are in <code>references/image-prompts.md</code> — reuse them for your own set.</span></p>
</div></section>

<section style="padding-top:10px" id="wallpapers"><div class="wrap">
