      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">放风筝 · 桌面</span><span class="lang-en">The kite · desktop</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1672 × 941 · 上面 55% 留空,放图标不挡画</span><span class="lang-en">1672 × 941 · the top 55% is empty so icons do not cover anything</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset phone g-box"><a href="media/wall-phone.webp" download><img src="media/wall-phone.webp" width="941" height="1672" alt="手机壁纸:夜空下小机器人坐在小山顶,旁边一盏橙色纸灯笼" data-label-zh="手机壁纸:夜空下小机器人坐在小山顶,旁边一盏橙色纸灯笼" data-label-en="Phone wallpaper: under a night sky the robot sits on a hilltop beside an orange paper lantern" loading="lazy"></a>
