      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">机房巡检 · 深色宽银幕</span><span class="lang-en">Server room · dark widescreen</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1916 × 821 · 只有手电筒一个光源</span><span class="lang-en">1916 × 821 · the torch is the only light</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset g-box"><a href="media/hero.webp" download><img src="media/hero.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="白板前的小机器人,浅色" data-label-zh="白板前的小机器人,浅色" data-label-en="The robot at the whiteboard, light" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">白板 · 浅色</span><span class="lang-en">Whiteboard · light</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1672 × 941 · 白板是空的:板面在 x 677–1384、y 220–639,网页在上面画</span><span class="lang-en">1672 × 941 · the board is blank: x 677–1384, y 220–639, for the page to draw on</span></figcaption></figure>
